{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17212120","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17212120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"picture:0::0":{"text":"Neon Carp","source_cn":"霓光鲤","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50BAF4CAFFCA56A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721212001:0":{"text":"You close your eyes and focus, feeling for even the faintest stir of magic.","source_cn":"你闭上双眼，细心感受着指尖流动着的魔法波动。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x60C6E003504EF399","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You close your eyes and focus, feeling for even the faintest stir of magic.","female":"You close your eyes and focus, feeling for even the faintest stir of magic.","variant_male_record_index":"228863","variant_female_record_index":"228864","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721212002:1":{"text":"Nothing. Absolutely nothing. The plump fish merely stares back at you with the blank innocence of a creature that has never had a single thought in its life, then blows one pathetic bubble.","source_cn":"——没有。你什么也没有感受到。肥美的大鱼呆呆地望着你，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA12BDDA7ED9F7034","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Nothing. Absolutely nothing. The plump fish merely stares back at you with the blank innocence of a creature that has never had a single thought in its life, then blows one pathetic bubble.","female":"Nothing. Absolutely nothing. The plump fish merely stares back at you with the blank innocence of a creature that has never had a single thought in its life, then blows one pathetic bubble.","variant_male_record_index":"228865","variant_female_record_index":"228866","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721212003:0":{"text":"No doubt about it. This is just an ordinary carp that happened to mutate a little and ended up with some extra patterning on its fins.","source_cn":"毫无疑问，这就是一条普通的鲤鱼，只因为变异，在鱼鳍上多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD1CF5B976C8EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721212004:1":{"text":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","source_cn":"梅林阁下，这条鱼……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x573A4A4CD4883545","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","female":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","variant_male_record_index":"228868","variant_female_record_index":"228869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1721212004":{"text":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","source_cn":"梅林阁下，这条鱼……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x573A4A4CD4883545","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","female":"Magister Merlin... this fish...","variant_male_record_index":"228868","variant_female_record_index":"228869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721212005:0":{"text":"Wh-What? No, that can't be right! Look again! This isn't some common river fish—it's the neon carp! I paid a million gold for it!","source_cn":"什、什么？！这不可能，绝对不可能！您再看看，这条鱼不可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54083BF159CE7A3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721212006:0":{"text":"Baron Grandet, you paraded an ordinary fish around as a miracle cure and attempted to pass it off to the royal court as the king's salvation.","source_cn":"葛朗台男爵，你谎称这条普通的鱼为所谓的“神鱼”，甚至愚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9040F6A1AC7E50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721212007:0":{"text":"You spread lies for your own advantage and made a mockery of the throne in the process.","source_cn":"为牟取个人名利，四处散布谣言，冒犯君权。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C314C71AD7E38EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721212008:1":{"text":"Under the laws of Savannah, that is treason. You are under arrest.","source_cn":"依照赛凡纳的律令，你已触冒犯君主罪。守备军将即刻对你实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A1DC225062C180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721212009:1":{"text":"Guards. Take him!","source_cn":"来人，带走他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A7E1522F37B97FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721212010:1":{"text":"Yes, Captain!","source_cn":"是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C95ED2FBC5CEF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721212011:1":{"text":"Wait, wait, easy with the arm! This is a misunderstanding! I'm telling you, there's been a mistake!","source_cn":"等……哎哟，不要抓我的胳膊！——等一下！这一定是误会，误会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B256D192779A151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721212012:1":{"text":"I really did pay a million gold for that fish! I didn't make any of this up! I'm the wronged party here! I demand the right to appeal as a baron—","source_cn":"我真的花了一百万买这条鱼！我没说谎，我冤枉啊！我不认罪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x481B5727AB8315FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"There's no magic in it.","source_cn":"这条鱼身上没有魔力","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDA8C1D9B73E70B0F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There's no magic in it.","female":"There's no magic in it.","variant_male_record_index":"89489","variant_female_record_index":"89490","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"It's just a common fish.","source_cn":"这只是一条普通的鱼","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B071F62B7817CF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's just a common fish.","female":"It's just a common fish.","variant_male_record_index":"89491","variant_female_record_index":"89492","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_sta